# 2026-09-09 — Text-fidelity guardrails (baseline math + pristine event flip).
# Both files carry rules where reverting a small edit produces the exact QA
# regression the user reported this session ("font family missing on
# download", "text placement 15pt off at fontSize 96"). Full evidence in
# `.claude/skills/pdf-editor-architecture/SKILL.md` entries 2026-09-09 (a) + (b)
# and `.claude/specs/2026-09-09-editor-text-fidelity.md`.
#
# `vector-drawers.ts` — baseline placement in drawIText MUST use
#   `fontSize * FABRIC_BASELINE_MULT` (0.87914). Do NOT switch back to
#   `font.heightAtSize(size, {descender:false})` — that under-shoots by
#   ~16% of fontSize and re-introduces the visible upward drift on export.
#
# `FloatingTextToolbar.tsx` — applyStyle MUST end with
#   `fabricCanvas.fire("object:modified", { target: obj })`. Without it,
#   pristine editModeText stays flagged unchanged and merge-pdf.ts
#   copies the source page byte-for-byte, silently discarding the user's
#   font/size/bold/italic/color/align pick on download.
